# 本目录直接文件说明

仅列出本目录文件；子目录内容请查看对应目录中的 `tree`。

- `AppLock.kt` — Optional device credential gate with secure windows and explicit unlock.
- `CredentialCipher.kt` — Versioned authenticated credential envelope with provider-associated AES-GCM encryption.
- `DocumentTransfer.kt` — Bounded SAF document stream transfer with failure-safe private staging.
- `LedgerActivity.kt` — NativeActivity launcher for the Rust Slint ledger UI.
- `LocalDataDeletion.kt` — Stops Android capture and erases Keystore credentials and private staging after ledger deletion.
- `MainActivity.kt` — Notification permission explanation, settings jump, and source preferences.
- `NotificationCaptureService.kt` — Android system notification adapter entry point.
- `ProviderCredentialStore.kt` — Android Keystore keys and atomic ciphertext-only storage excluded from system backup.
- `RustBridge.kt` — Narrow Kotlin-to-Rust JNI interface.
- `tree` — 本目录直接文件的说明索引。
